  "body": "### Fixes\n- fix: skill and rule files under the agent's config dir reach the model whole; Read deny names a route that works; CTX_REPLACE_TRIGGER_BYTES setting (#1326)\n- fix: OpenCode ctx_* tools go through OpenCode permission rules (#1331)\n- fix: post-compact recall queries the current prompt only, not the first prompt (#1330)\n- fix: setup checks Node first and names Node too old, one text for cli, server, hook and doctor D2 (#1328, #1329)\n- fix: codex MCP entry carries CODEX_HOME so doctor D3 passes in Codex Desktop (#1327)\n- fix: ZCode Read of images over 16 KB reaches the model; doctor D5 sends the media probe for zcode (#1333)\n- fix: issue intake sets type labels, reads setup reports, marks same-fingerprint duplicates\n\n### Who gets this\n\nOne version on both channels: the release commit on main (GitHub) and npm.\n\n| Agent | Channel | Update with |\n|---|---|---|\n| Claude Code | GitHub | `claude plugin update context-mode@context-mode` |\n| Codex | GitHub, npm for the one-time hook trust step | `codex plugin marketplace upgrade context-mode` |\n| Gemini CLI | GitHub | `gemini extensions update context-mode` |\n| Qwen Code | GitHub | `qwen extensions update context-mode` |\n| Copilot CLI | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| VS Code (Copilot) | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| Kiro | npm | `context-mode upgrade` |\n| ZCode | GitHub | `zcode plugins update context-mode@context-mode` |\n| Pi | npm | `pi update --extensions` |\n| OpenCode | npm | `opencode plugin update` |",
